---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Services | Iqbal Abdurachman" description="Performance marketing experience, skills, and education for Iqbal Abdurachman.">
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<main class="wrapper about">
			<header class="page-hero">
				<div class="container narrow">
					<p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
					<h1>Performance marketing built around growth.</h1>
					<p class="subtitle">I turn acquisition data into clearer decisions, stronger funnels, and more efficient growth across fintech, B2B SaaS, and e-commerce.</p>
					<img width="1553" height="873" src="/assets/foto iqbal.jpg" alt="Iqbal Abdurachman" />
				</div>
			</header>

			<section class="profile-section">
				<div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">About me</p><h2>Performance Marketing Specialist with 5+ years driving paid acquisition.</h2></div>
				<div class="content"><p>Strong in SQL-based data analysis and full-funnel conversion optimization, with a track record of improving CPA, CVR, and ROAS across fintech, B2B SaaS, and e-commerce. Experienced managing large ad budgets and turning performance data into growth strategy.</p></div>
			</section>

			<section class="profile-section">
				<div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Working experience</p><h2>Building better acquisition systems from click to conversion.</h2></div>
				<div class="timeline">
					<article class="role"><div class="role-heading"><h3>Performance Marketing Specialist</h3><span>Aug 2025 - Present</span></div><div class="company-row"><img src="/assets/logos/hsb-investasi.png" alt="HSB Investasi logo" /><p class="company">HSB Investasi</p></div><p>Digital trading platform for forex and multi-asset investing.</p><ul><li>Manage Google Ads, Meta Ads, TikTok Ads, Apple Search Ads, X Ads, and third-party ad networks.</li><li>Run full-funnel acquisition campaigns, focusing on Install to First Time Deposit conversion performance.</li><li>Manage and optimize 11+ ad network and affiliate channels while improving traffic quality, conversion rates, and FTD contribution.</li><li>Monitor attribution and conversion tracking through AppsFlyer, Google Ads, Apple Search Ads, and other marketing platforms.</li><li>Analyze CAC, CPA, CPL, ROAS, conversion rate, cost per funnel, FTD, deposit value, and trading activity.</li><li>Use SQL and basic Python to analyze marketing performance data and share insights with the team.</li></ul></article>
					<article class="role"><div class="role-heading"><h3>Performance Marketing Specialist</h3><span>Dec 2024 - Jul 2025</span></div><div class="company-row"><img src="/assets/logos/borong.png" alt="Borong logo" /><p class="company">Borong Indonesia</p></div><p>B2B marketplace and SaaS platform connecting brands, suppliers, and businesses.</p><ul><li>Planned, launched, and managed paid campaigns across search, social, display, and marketplace advertising.</li><li>Optimized campaigns toward ROAS, CPA, and other business KPIs.</li><li>Managed Facebook Ads and Google Ads with efficient budget allocation and targeting.</li><li>Analyzed website performance to identify UX and conversion rate optimization opportunities.</li><li>Created performance reports and recommendations for stakeholders.</li><li>A/B tested ad creatives, landing pages, and funnels to improve acquisition efficiency.</li></ul></article>
					<article class="role"><div class="role-heading"><h3>Digital Marketing Specialist, SEO &amp; SEM</h3><span>Jan 2024 - Nov 2024</span></div><div class="company-row"><img src="/assets/logos/yukk.png" alt="YUKK Payment Gateway logo" /><p class="company">YUKK Indonesia</p></div><ul><li>Improved lead quality by up to 200% in the first month through stronger campaign structure, ad quality, and relevancy.</li><li>Generated up to 500% lead growth in the second month.</li><li>Led projects to generate more event organizers using YUKK payment services.</li><li>Improved website UX, traffic quality, and structure through a website revamp.</li></ul></article>
					<article class="role"><div class="role-heading"><h3>Digital Marketing</h3><span>Sep 2021 - Dec 2023</span></div><div class="company-row"><img src="/assets/logos/peopleshift.png" alt="PeopleShift logo" /><p class="company">PeopleShift</p></div><p>Strategized, planned, and executed SEO, SEM, social media, and content initiatives.</p><ul><li>Received Employee of the Month recognition in January 2022.</li><li>Drove a 90K increase in website traffic over 12 months for Shift Academy through SEO and content improvements.</li><li>Achieved 44.3% Instagram follower growth and a 6,600% reach increase quarter over quarter.</li><li>Managed IDR 150 million in annual ad spend and achieved a 10% average ROI increase over two quarters.</li></ul></article>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="profile-section two-column">
				<div><p class="eyebrow">Education</p><h2>Learning with intent.</h2><div class="education-item"><h3>International Relations, Bachelor's Degree</h3><p class="company">Muhammadiyah University of Yogyakarta · Aug 2016 - Feb 2021</p><p>GPA: 3.34. Wrote a thesis on digital campaigns for one of the largest international NGOs, with a focus on transnational society and community development.</p></div><div class="education-item"><div class="company-row"><img src="/assets/logos/revou.ico" alt="RevoU logo" /><h3>Fullstack Digital Marketing</h3></div><p class="company">RevoU · May 2023 - Sep 2023</p><p>Score: 96/100. Completed 200+ hours of lectures and more than 35 assignments across organic and paid marketing.</p></div></div>
				<div><p class="eyebrow">Additional information</p><h2>Tools, skills, and credentials.</h2><div class="education-item"><h3>Skills</h3><p>Social media management, Meta Ads, Google Ads, Apple Search Ads, TikTok Ads, X Ads, SQL, analytics, market research, content marketing, Adobe Photoshop, and WordPress development.</p></div><div class="education-item"><h3>Certifications</h3><ul><li>Fullstack Digital Marketing, RevoU - Sep 2023</li><li>SEO Specialization Bootcamp, Belajarlagi - Nov 2022</li><li>Google Ads Search Certification, Google - Sep 2023</li><li>Google Analytics Certification, Google - Sep 2023</li></ul></div></div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<ContactCTA />
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3.5rem;
	}

	.page-hero {
		position: relative;
		width: 100vw;
		left: 50%;
		margin-left: 0;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		padding: 5rem 1rem 4rem;
		background: var(--blue-soft);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.narrow {
		max-width: 48rem;
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		color: var(--blue);
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.page-hero h1 {
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
	}

	.subtitle {
		margin-top: 1.25rem;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.profile-section {
		display: grid;
		grid-column: 1 / -1;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(14rem, 0.7fr) 1.3fr;
		gap: 3rem;
		color: var(--muted);
	}

	.profile-section .section-heading h2,
	.two-column h2 {
		margin-top: 0.7rem;
		font-size: var(--text-2xl);
	}

	.profile-section .content {
		max-width: 48rem;
	}

	.timeline {
		display: grid;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.role {
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
	}

	.role-heading {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.role h3,
	.education-item h3 {
		color: var(--ink);
		font-size: 1.2rem;
	}

	.role-heading span {
		color: var(--blue);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.company {
		margin-top: 0.35rem;
		color: var(--blue);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.company-row {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.65rem;
		margin-top: 0.7rem;
	}

	.company-row .company {
		margin-top: 0;
	}

	.company-row img,
	.company-mark {
		display: grid;
		width: 4.5rem;
		height: 2rem;
		flex: 0 0 4.5rem;
		place-items: center;
		margin: 0;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 0.45rem;
		object-fit: contain;
		background: white;
	}

	.company-mark {
		color: var(--blue);
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-weight: 800;
	}

	.role > p:not(.company),
	.education-item p {
		margin-top: 0.6rem;
	}

	.role ul,
	.education-item ul {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.45rem;
		margin-top: 1rem;
		padding-left: 1.15rem;
	}

	.two-column {
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
	}

	.education-item + .education-item {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
	}

	.page-hero img {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		width: 100%;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
	}

	.content {
		max-width: 48rem;
		color: var(--muted);
	}

	.content :global(a) {
		text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
		transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
	}

	.content :global(a:hover),
	.content :global(a:focus) {
		text-decoration-color: currentColor;
	}

	@media (max-width: 50em) {
		.profile-section,
		.two-column {
			display: block;
		}

		.profile-section .content,
		.timeline,
		.two-column > div + div {
			margin-top: 2rem;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 40em) {
		.role-heading {
			align-items: flex-start;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 0.35rem;
		}
	}
</style>
